#: krandrmodule.cpp:82
msgid ""
"<qt>Your X server does not support resizing and rotating the display. Please "
"update to version 4.3 or greater. You need the X Resize And Rotate extension "
"(RANDR) version 1.1 or greater to use this feature.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Biredäge X-server küräk ülçäme belän anıñ borılışın üzgärtü totmí. Aları "
"kiräk bulsa, söreme kimendä 4.3 bulırğa tieş. Ul eşçänlek öçen \"X Resize And "
"Rotate extension\" (RANDR) söreme dä kimendä 1.1 bulırğa tieş.</qt>"

#: krandrmodule.cpp:91
msgid "Settings for screen:"
msgstr "Küräk köylämäläre:"

#: krandrmodule.cpp:95 krandrtray.cpp:83
#, c-format
msgid "Screen %1"
msgstr "%1 Küräk"

#: krandrmodule.cpp:100
msgid ""
"The screen whose settings you would like to change can be selected using this "
"drop-down list."
msgstr "Caylawın üzgärtäse kilgän küräkne bu atılma tezmädä saylap bula."

#: krandrmodule.cpp:109
msgid "Screen size:"
msgstr "Küräk ülçäme:"

#: krandrmodule.cpp:111
msgid ""
"The size, otherwise known as the resolution, of your screen can be selected "
"from this drop-down list."
msgstr "Biredäge küräk ülçämen bu atılma tezmädän saylap bula."

#: krandrmodule.cpp:117
msgid "Refresh rate:"
msgstr "Yañartu yışlığı:"

#: krandrmodule.cpp:119
msgid ""
"The refresh rate of your screen can be selected from this drop-down list."
msgstr "Biredäge küräkneñ yañartılu yışlığın bu atılma tezmädän saylap bula."

#: krandrmodule.cpp:123
msgid "Orientation (degrees counterclockwise)"
msgstr "Yünälü (gradus)"

#: krandrmodule.cpp:126
msgid ""
"The options in this section allow you to change the rotation of your screen."
msgstr "Bu bülek köylämäläre aşa küräk borılışın üzgärtep bula."

#: krandrmodule.cpp:128
msgid "Apply settings on KDE startup"
msgstr "KDE cibärgändä caylawlarnı aşırası"

#: krandrmodule.cpp:130
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled the size and orientation settings will be used when "
"KDE starts."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä yanıq torsa, KDE cibärelgändä ülçäm belän yünälü caylawı öçen boları "
"qullanılaçaq."

#: krandrmodule.cpp:135
msgid "Allow tray application to change startup settings"
msgstr "Ulaq yazılımına cibärelü caylawların üzgärtergä birü"

#: krandrmodule.cpp:137
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, options set by the system tray applet will be saved "
"and loaded when KDE starts instead of being temporary."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä yanıq torsa, sistem ulağınıñ köylämäläre saqlanıp, KDE cibärelgändä "
"kire yöklängän bulaçaq, yä isä alar waqıtlı ğına bula."

#: krandrmodule.cpp:174 krandrtray.cpp:149
msgid "%1 x %2"
msgstr "%1 x %2"

#: krandrtray.cpp:45
msgid "Screen resize & rotate"
msgstr "Küräk ülçäme & borılışı"

#: krandrtray.cpp:69
msgid "Required X Extension Not Available"
msgstr "Kiräk X-Quşılma Barlıqta Yuq"

#: krandrtray.cpp:94
msgid "Configure Display..."
msgstr "Küreneş Caylawı..."

#: krandrtray.cpp:117
msgid "Screen configuration has changed"
msgstr "Küräk caylawı üzgärtelgän buldı"

#: krandrtray.cpp:128
msgid "Screen Size"
msgstr "Küräk Ülçäme"

#: krandrtray.cpp:181
msgid "Refresh Rate"
msgstr "Yañartu Yışlığı"

#: krandrtray.cpp:251
msgid "Configure Display"
msgstr "Küreneş Caylaw"

#: ktimerdialog.cpp:154
#, c-format
msgid ""
"_n: 1 second remaining:\n"
"%n seconds remaining:"
msgstr "%n sekund qala:"

#: main.cpp:32
msgid "Application is being auto-started at KDE session start"
msgstr "Bu yazılım KDE sessi cibärelgän çaqtan uq eşli"

#: main.cpp:38
msgid "Resize and Rotate"
msgstr "Ülçäm belän Borılış"

#: main.cpp:38
msgid "Resize and Rotate System Tray App"
msgstr "Sistem Ulaq Yazılımınıñ Ülçäm belän Borılışı"

#: main.cpp:39
msgid "Maintainer"
msgstr "Bulışuçı"

#: main.cpp:40
msgid "Many fixes"
msgstr "Küp tözätmä"

#: randr.cpp:161
msgid "Confirm Display Setting Change"
msgstr "Küreneş Caylaw Üzgärtüen Raslaw"

#: randr.cpp:165
msgid "&Accept Configuration"
msgstr "Caylawnı &Alası"

#: randr.cpp:166
msgid "&Return to Previous Configuration"
msgstr "Üzğan Caylawğa &Qayt"

#: randr.cpp:168
msgid ""
"Your screen orientation, size and refresh rate have been changed to the "
"requested settings. Please indicate whether you wish to keep this "
"configuration. In 15 seconds the display will revert to your previous settings."
msgstr ""
"Küräkneñ yünälü, ülçäm, yışlıq köylämäläre üzgärtelgän buldı. Alarnı saqlísı "
"bulsa, endäşergä kiräk. 15 sekund uzğannan soñ iske köyläwlär qaytarılır."

#: randr.cpp:196
msgid ""
"New configuration:\n"
"Resolution: %1 x %2\n"
"Orientation: %3"
msgstr ""
"Yaña caylaw:\n"
"Adımlıq: %1 x %2\n"
"Yünälü: %3"

#: randr.cpp:201
msgid ""
"New configuration:\n"
"Resolution: %1 x %2\n"
"Orientation: %3\n"
"Refresh rate: %4"
msgstr ""
"Yaña caylaw:\n"
"Adımlıq: %1 x %2\n"
"Yünälü: %3\n"
"Yañaru yışlığı: %4"

